    fix(02): resolve phase 2 code review findings (CR-01, WR-03, IN-01-02)
    
    Phase 2 critical and warning fixes:
    - CR-01: Add try-catch error handling for cursor JSON parsing
    - WR-01: Add Bearer-token authentication to binance-spike endpoint (in admin.ts)
    - WR-02: Use timing-safe token comparison to prevent timing attacks (in admin.ts)
    - WR-03: Add validation for malformed ingest response and proper error handling
    
    Phase 2 info fixes:
    - IN-01: Remove unnecessary null coalescing in backoff sleep call
    - IN-02: Add number range validation to ingest schema (finite, positive constraints)

