commit de2f856ad8bdd1696881026ec71fb91f40ca00b6
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Aug 31 01:44:45 2026 +0900

    test: add TDD tests verifying Phase 1/2 fixes
    
    - Phase 1 CR-01: timestamp conversion (ms -> s) in GET /api/klines
    - Phase 2 CR-01: cursor fetch error handling (malformed/missing JSON)
    - Phase 2 WR-02: timing-safe token comparison in admin auth
    
    Refactors scripts/backfill-fetcher.mts to export a testable fetchCursor()
    and guard the top-level main() invocation behind an entry-point check so
    the module can be imported by tests without side effects. Adds
    @vitest/coverage-v8 devDependency for coverage reporting.

